            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0009910</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The integration of epidemiologic, sociological, economic, and other analytic sciences in the study of health services. Health services research is usually concerned with relationships between need, demand, supply, use, and outcome of health services. The aim of the research is evaluation, particularly in terms of structure, process, output, and outcome. (From Last, Dictionary of Epidemiology, 2d ed)</dd>
            

